LIMB (b) -- EMPIRICAL, OVER THE PRODUCED ARTIFACT: the zero-empty-field census
================================================================================

Taken over the scratch smoke `prune.csv` -- the ARMED cell, where the scrape
gate is in full force. Not "the columns exist"; not "the later rows are fine".
Every cell of every column of every row, FIRST ROW INCLUDED.

INVOCATION (verbatim, as run):

  SPEC356_SMOKE_DURATION=120 SPEC356_SMOKE_SAMPLE_INTERVAL=10 \
  SPEC356_OUT_DIR=/tmp/spec356-smoke bash spec356-prune.sh smoke

  $ awk -F, '{ for (i = 1; i <= NF; i++) if ($i == "") e++ } END { print "empty_fields=" e + 0 }' \
      /tmp/spec356-smoke/spec356-smoke.prune.csv

